message: "If you cite this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Reflective Rust"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation workspace for Reflective Rust: provenance-aware runtime
  semantic projection and operational semantic graphs in Rust. Language and
  compiler proposals in the repository are versioned independently of this
  workspace package version; see docs/meta/versioning.md. Stable Rust compiler reflection is
  not simulated.
